e relation</strong>, qui correspond =C3=A0 une <strong data-start=3D"864" d=
ata-end=3D"873">table</strong> en base de donn=C3=A9es. Ce mod=C3=A8le a =
=C3=A9t=C3=A9 invent=C3=A9 par <strong data-start=3D"922" data-end=3D"939">=
Edgar F. Codd</strong> en 1970.</p>
<p data-start=3D"950" data-end=3D"1068">Une <strong data-start=3D"954" data=
