<h2 data-start=3D"4145" data-end=3D"4160">=E2=9C=85 D=C3=A9finition</h2>
<p data-start=3D"4161" data-end=3D"4276">Une <strong data-start=3D"4165" da=
ta-end=3D"4181">cl=C3=A9 primaire</strong> est une ou plusieurs colonnes qu=
i permettent de <strong data-start=3D"4230" data-end=3D"4275">distinguer ch=
aque ligne de mani=C3=A8re unique</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"4278" data-end=3D"4309">Elle respecte les contraintes :</p=
>
<ul data-start=3D"4310" data-end=3D"4378">
<li data-start=3D"4310" data-end=3D"4337">
