<h2 data-start=3D"5434" data-end=3D"5467">8.3. Performance et indexation</h=
2>
<p data-start=3D"5469" data-end=3D"5533">La cl=C3=A9 primaire <strong data-=
start=3D"5485" data-end=3D"5518">cr=C3=A9e automatiquement un index</strong=
