<hr data-start=3D"2463" data-end=3D"2466">
<h1 data-start=3D"2468" data-end=3D"2499">=F0=9F=93=8E 3. Int=C3=A9grit=C3=
=A9 r=C3=A9f=C3=A9rentielle</h1>
<h2 data-start=3D"2501" data-end=3D"2516">=E2=9C=85 D=C3=A9finition</h2>
<p data-start=3D"2518" data-end=3D"2650">L=E2=80=99<strong data-start=3D"25=
20" data-end=3D"2547">int=C3=A9grit=C3=A9 r=C3=A9f=C3=A9rentielle</strong> =
garantit que chaque valeur de cl=C3=A9 =C3=A9trang=C3=A8re <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"2592" data-end=3D"2624">r=C3=A9f=C3=A8re =C3=A0 une ligne existante</=
strong> dans la table r=C3=A9f=C3=A9renc=C3=A9e.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2652" data-end=3D"2667">Cela signifie :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2668" data-end=3D"2855">
<li data-start=3D"2668" data-end=3D"2735">
<p data-start=3D"2670" data-end=3D"2735">On <strong data-start=3D"2673" dat=
a-end=3D"2696">ne peut pas ins=C3=A9rer</strong> une commande avec un clien=
t inexistant</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2736" data-end=3D"2855">
<p data-start=3D"2738" data-end=3D"2855">On <strong data-start=3D"2741" dat=
a-end=3D"2766">ne peut pas supprimer</strong> un client s=E2=80=99il a enco=
re des commandes (sauf si l=E2=80=99on d=C3=A9finit un comportement particu=
lier)</p>
</li>
</ul>
