<h1 data-start=3D"922" data-end=3D"966">=F0=9F=A7=A9 1. Qu=E2=80=99est-ce q=
u=E2=80=99une contrainte en SQL ?</h1>
<p data-start=3D"968" data-end=3D"1121">Une <strong data-start=3D"972" data=
-end=3D"986">contrainte</strong> en SQL est une <strong data-start=3D"1002"=
 data-end=3D"1047">r=C3=A8gle impos=C3=A9e =C3=A0 une ou plusieurs colonnes=
</strong> d'une table afin de <strong data-start=3D"1068" data-end=3D"1120"=
>prot=C3=A9ger l=E2=80=99int=C3=A9grit=C3=A9 et la coh=C3=A9rence des donn=
=C3=A9es</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1123" data-end=3D"1154">Les contraintes sont =C3=A9valu=C3=
=A9es :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1155" data-end=3D"1282">
<li data-start=3D"1155" data-end=3D"1191">
<p data-start=3D"1157" data-end=3D"1191">Lors de l=E2=80=99<strong data-sta=
rt=3D"1167" data-end=3D"1191">insertion (<code data-start=3D"1180" data-end=
=3D"1188">INSERT</code>)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1192" data-end=3D"1231">
<p data-start=3D"1194" data-end=3D"1231">Lors de la <strong data-start=3D"1=
205" data-end=3D"1231">mise =C3=A0 jour (<code data-start=3D"1220" data-end=
=3D"1228">UPDATE</code>)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1232" data-end=3D"1282">
<p data-start=3D"1234" data-end=3D"1282">Et parfois lors de la <strong data=
-start=3D"1256" data-end=3D"1282">suppression (<code data-start=3D"1271" da=
ta-end=3D"1279">DELETE</code>)</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
