1375" data-end=3D"1427">la colonne ne peut pas contenir de valeur <code dat=
a-start=3D"1419" data-end=3D"1425">NULL</code></strong>.</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"1430" data-end=3D"1514">
<p data-start=3D"1432" data-end=3D"1514">En SQL, <code data-start=3D"1440" =
