<hr data-start=3D"902" data-end=3D"905">
<h1 data-start=3D"907" data-end=3D"948">=F0=9F=94=B9 1. Qu=E2=80=99est-ce q=
ue la clause <code data-start=3D"939" data-end=3D"946">WHERE</code> ?</h1>
<p data-start=3D"950" data-end=3D"1073">La clause <code data-start=3D"960" =
data-end=3D"967">WHERE</code> permet de <strong data-start=3D"978" data-end=
=3D"1000">filtrer les lignes</strong> d=E2=80=99une table selon des conditi=
ons. Elle est utilis=C3=A9e dans les commandes :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1075" data-end=3D"1203">
<li data-start=3D"1075" data-end=3D"1114">
<p data-start=3D"1077" data-end=3D"1114"><code data-start=3D"1077" data-end=
=3D"1085">SELECT</code> (pour lire certaines lignes)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1115" data-end=3D"1158">
<p data-start=3D"1117" data-end=3D"1158"><code data-start=3D"1117" data-end=
=3D"1125">UPDATE</code> (pour modifier certaines lignes)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1159" data-end=3D"1203">
<p data-start=3D"1161" data-end=3D"1203"><code data-start=3D"1161" data-end=
=3D"1169">DELETE</code> (pour supprimer certaines lignes)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1205" data-end=3D"1312">Elle agit comme <strong data-start=
=3D"1221" data-end=3D"1234">un filtre</strong> : seules les lignes qui sati=
sfont =C3=A0 la condition sp=C3=A9cifi=C3=A9e seront concern=C3=A9es.</p>
