ul=C3=A9es et des sous-requ=C3=AAtes en nommant les r=C3=A9sultats</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"770" data-end=3D"863">
<p data-start=3D"772" data-end=3D"863">Ma=C3=AEtriser les alias dans des co=
ntextes avanc=C3=A9s (jointures, vues, requ=C3=AAtes imbriqu=C3=A9es, etc.)=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"865" data-end=3D"868">
<h1 data-start=3D"870" data-end=3D"908">=F0=9F=94=B9 1. Qu=E2=80=99est-ce q=
u=E2=80=99un alias (<code data-start=3D"901" data-end=3D"905">AS</code>) ?<=
/h1>
<p data-start=3D"910" data-end=3D"1011">Un <strong data-start=3D"913" data-=
end=3D"922">alias</strong> est un <strong data-start=3D"930" data-end=3D"94=
8">nom temporaire</strong> donn=C3=A9 =C3=A0 une <strong data-start=3D"961"=
 data-end=3D"972">colonne</strong> ou une <strong data-start=3D"980" data-e=
nd=3D"989">table</strong> dans une requ=C3=AAte SQL.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1013" data-end=3D"1043">L'instruction <code data-start=3D"=
1027" data-end=3D"1031">AS</code> permet de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1045" data-end=3D"1253">
<li data-start=3D"1045" data-end=3D"1092">
<p data-start=3D"1047" data-end=3D"1092">Renommer une colonne dans le r=C3=
=A9sultat affich=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1093" data-end=3D"1164">
<p data-start=3D"1095" data-end=3D"1164">Donner un nom =C3=A0 une expressio=
n (calcul, concat=C3=A9nation, agr=C3=A9gat, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1165" data-end=3D"1210">
<p data-start=3D"1167" data-end=3D"1210">Simplifier l'=C3=A9criture de requ=
=C3=AAtes complexes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1211" data-end=3D"1253">
<p data-start=3D"1213" data-end=3D"1253">Clarifier le sens des donn=C3=A9es=
 retourn=C3=A9es</p>
</li>
</ul>
<blockquote data-start=3D"1255" data-end=3D"1363">
<p data-start=3D"1257" data-end=3D"1363">=F0=9F=8E=AF L=E2=80=99alias <stro=
ng data-start=3D"1268" data-end=3D"1311">ne modifie pas la structure de la =
table</strong>. Il n=E2=80=99existe que pendant l=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cution de=
 la requ=C3=AAte.</p>
</blockquote>
