t=3D"3235" data-end=3D"3245">LONGTEXT</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3248" data-end=3D"3310">
<p data-start=3D"3250" data-end=3D"3310"><strong data-start=3D"3250" data-e=
nd=3D"3264">PostgreSQL</strong> : <code data-start=3D"3267" data-end=3D"327=
3">TEXT</code> =E2=89=88 <code data-start=3D"3276" data-end=3D"3288">VARCHA=
R(n)</code> sans limite explicite</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
