<li data-start=3D"3328" data-end=3D"3389">
<p data-start=3D"3330" data-end=3D"3389">Peut stocker <strong data-start=3D=
"3343" data-end=3D"3388">des milliers voire millions de caract=C3=A8res</st=
rong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3390" data-end=3D"3440">
<p data-start=3D"3392" data-end=3D"3440">Parfait pour des contenus HTML, JS=
ON, logs, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-start=3D"3442" data-end=3D"3460">=E2=9D=8C Inconv=C3=A9nients</h2>
