<hr data-start=3D"6399" data-end=3D"6402">
<h1 data-start=3D"6404" data-end=3D"6425">=F0=9F=A7=BE Bonnes pratiques</h1=
>
<p data-start=3D"6427" data-end=3D"6439">=E2=9C=85 Utilisez :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6441" data-end=3D"6687">
<li data-start=3D"6441" data-end=3D"6469">
<p data-start=3D"6443" data-end=3D"6469"><code data-start=3D"6443" data-end=
=3D"6448">INT</code> pour les IDs simples</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6470" data-end=3D"6532">
<p data-start=3D"6472" data-end=3D"6532"><code data-start=3D"6472" data-end=
=3D"6480">BIGINT</code> pour les cl=C3=A9s globalement uniques (ex : UUIDs =
num.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6533" data-end=3D"6565">
<p data-start=3D"6535" data-end=3D"6565"><code data-start=3D"6535" data-end=
=3D"6544">DECIMAL</code> pour la comptabilit=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6566" data-end=3D"6613">
<p data-start=3D"6568" data-end=3D"6613"><code data-start=3D"6568" data-end=
=3D"6582">FLOAT/DOUBLE</code> pour des donn=C3=A9es scientifiques</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6614" data-end=3D"6687">
<p data-start=3D"6616" data-end=3D"6687"><code data-start=3D"6616" data-end=
=3D"6626">UNSIGNED</code> pour =C3=A9viter les valeurs n=C3=A9gatives l=C3=
=A0 o=C3=B9 ce n=E2=80=99est pas logique</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6689" data-end=3D"6699">=E2=9D=8C =C3=89vitez :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6701" data-end=3D"6850">
<li data-start=3D"6701" data-end=3D"6724">
<p data-start=3D"6703" data-end=3D"6724"><code data-start=3D"6703" data-end=
=3D"6710">FLOAT</code> pour l=E2=80=99argent</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6725" data-end=3D"6782">
<p data-start=3D"6727" data-end=3D"6782"><code data-start=3D"6727" data-end=
=3D"6735">BIGINT</code> pour tout sans justification (surco=C3=BBt m=C3=A9m=
oire)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6783" data-end=3D"6850">
<p data-start=3D"6785" data-end=3D"6850">Ignorer la pr=C3=A9cision n=C3=A9c=
essaire en amont (choisir arbitrairement)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6852" data-end=3D"6855">
<h1 data-start=3D"6857" data-end=3D"6882">=F0=9F=93=9A Pour aller plus loin=
</h1>
<ul data-start=3D"6884" data-end=3D"7085">
<li data-start=3D"6884" data-end=3D"6933">
<p data-start=3D"6886" data-end=3D"6933"><code data-start=3D"6886" data-end=
=3D"6894">SERIAL</code> (PostgreSQL) =3D <code data-start=3D"6910" data-end=
=3D"6933">BIGINT AUTO_INCREMENT</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6934" data-end=3D"6999">
<p data-start=3D"6936" data-end=3D"6999">PostgreSQL stocke <code data-start=
=3D"6954" data-end=3D"6963">NUMERIC</code> =3D <code data-start=3D"6966" da=
ta-end=3D"6975">DECIMAL</code> en pr=C3=A9cision arbitraire</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7000" data-end=3D"7085">
<p data-start=3D"7002" data-end=3D"7085">MySQL a des limitations sur la tai=
lle max de <code data-start=3D"7047" data-end=3D"7055">(M, D)</code> dans <=
code data-start=3D"7061" data-end=3D"7070">DECIMAL</code> (~65 chiffres)</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
