<hr data-start=3D"5690" data-end=3D"5693">
<h2 data-start=3D"5695" data-end=3D"5720">=F0=9F=A7=A0 8. Bonnes pratiques<=
/h2>
<p data-start=3D"5722" data-end=3D"5733">=E2=9C=85 =C3=80 faire :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5735" data-end=3D"5976">
<li data-start=3D"5735" data-end=3D"5791">
<p data-start=3D"5737" data-end=3D"5791">Utiliser <code data-start=3D"5746"=
 data-end=3D"5752">DATE</code> pour des dates seules (ex : naissance)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5792" data-end=3D"5867">
<p data-start=3D"5794" data-end=3D"5867">Utiliser <code data-start=3D"5803"=
 data-end=3D"5814">TIMESTAMP</code> pour des logs ou donn=C3=A9es d=C3=A9pe=
ndantes du temps global</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5868" data-end=3D"5976">
<p data-start=3D"5870" data-end=3D"5976">Utiliser <code data-start=3D"5879"=
 data-end=3D"5889">DATETIME</code> pour des =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements dat=C3=A9s=
 mais constants dans leur fuseau (ex : RDV fix=C3=A9 =C3=A0 Paris =C3=A0 9h=
)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"5978" data-end=3D"5990">=E2=9D=8C =C3=80 =C3=A9viter :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5992" data-end=3D"6219">
<li data-start=3D"5992" data-end=3D"6074">
<p data-start=3D"5994" data-end=3D"6074">Comparer <code data-start=3D"6003"=
 data-end=3D"6014">TIMESTAMP</code> avec <code data-start=3D"6020" data-end=
=3D"6030">DATETIME</code> sans conversion (risque d'erreur de fuseau)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6075" data-end=3D"6153">
<p data-start=3D"6077" data-end=3D"6153">Utiliser <code data-start=3D"6086"=
 data-end=3D"6095">VARCHAR</code> pour stocker des dates (probl=C3=A8mes de=
 tri, de performance)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6154" data-end=3D"6219">
<p data-start=3D"6156" data-end=3D"6219">Ignorer la gestion des fuseaux dan=
s les applications multi-pays</p>
</li>
</ul>
