<ul data-start=3D"6611" data-end=3D"6900">
<li data-start=3D"6611" data-end=3D"6694">
<p data-start=3D"6613" data-end=3D"6694">PostgreSQL : support de types =C3=
=A9tendus comme <code data-start=3D"6657" data-end=3D"6667">INTERVAL</code>=
