tart=3D"6681" data-end=3D"6694">TIMESTAMPTZ</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6695" data-end=3D"6738">
<p data-start=3D"6697" data-end=3D"6738">SQL Server : <code data-start=3D"6=
