<hr data-start=3D"7359" data-end=3D"7362">
<h2 data-start=3D"7364" data-end=3D"7392">=F0=9F=A7=AA 11. Exercices sugg=
=C3=A9r=C3=A9s</h2>
<ol data-start=3D"7394" data-end=3D"7763">
<li data-start=3D"7394" data-end=3D"7467">
<p data-start=3D"7397" data-end=3D"7467">Impl=C3=A9mente une transaction de=
 transfert de stock entre deux entrep=C3=B4ts.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7468" data-end=3D"7547">
<p data-start=3D"7471" data-end=3D"7547">Simule une panne apr=C3=A8s le pre=
