=A9es</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3533" data-end=3D"3601">=F0=9F=A7=A9 <strong data-start=3D=
"3536" data-end=3D"3548">Objectif</strong> : garantir la <strong data-start=
=3D"3563" data-end=3D"3576">p=C3=A9rennit=C3=A9</strong> des op=C3=A9ration=
s valid=C3=A9es.</p>
