<li data-start=3D"6289" data-end=3D"6336">
<p data-start=3D"6292" data-end=3D"6336"><strong data-start=3D"6292" data-e=
nd=3D"6317">D=C3=A9finir les attributs</strong> (caract=C3=A9ristiques)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6337" data-end=3D"6379">
<p data-start=3D"6340" data-end=3D"6379"><strong data-start=3D"6340" data-e=
nd=3D"6365">D=C3=A9finir les relations</strong> entre entit=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6380" data-end=3D"6430">
<p data-start=3D"6383" data-end=3D"6430"><strong data-start=3D"6383" data-e=
nd=3D"6414">D=C3=A9terminer les cardinalit=C3=A9s</strong> (1-1, 1-n, n-n)<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6431" data-end=3D"6466">
<p data-start=3D"6434" data-end=3D"6466"><strong data-start=3D"6434" data-e=
nd=3D"6466">D=C3=A9tecter les entit=C3=A9s faibles</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6467" data-end=3D"6553">
<p data-start=3D"6470" data-end=3D"6553"><strong data-start=3D"6470" data-e=
nd=3D"6505">Cr=C3=A9er un sch=C3=A9ma relationnel SQL</strong> conforme (ta=
bles, cl=C3=A9s primaires et =C3=A9trang=C3=A8res)</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"6555" data-end=3D"6558">
<h1 data-start=3D"6560" data-end=3D"6604">=F0=9F=93=8C Repr=C3=A9sentation =
visuelle (Merise ou UML)</h1>
<p data-start=3D"6606" data-end=3D"6739">On utilise g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement =
un <strong data-start=3D"6633" data-end=3D"6671">diagramme Entit=C3=A9-Asso=
ciation (E/A)</strong> ou un <strong data-start=3D"6678" data-end=3D"6706">=
diagramme UML de classes</strong> pour repr=C3=A9senter graphiquement :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6741" data-end=3D"6850">
<li data-start=3D"6741" data-end=3D"6763">
<p data-start=3D"6743" data-end=3D"6763">Entit=C3=A9s (rectangles)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6764" data-end=3D"6798">
