<li data-start=3D"6799" data-end=3D"6850">
<p data-start=3D"6801" data-end=3D"6850">Relations (losanges ou fl=C3=A8che=
s avec cardinalit=C3=A9s)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6852" data-end=3D"6855">
<h1 data-start=3D"6857" data-end=3D"6871">=E2=9C=85 Conclusion</h1>
<p data-start=3D"6873" data-end=3D"7034">La compr=C3=A9hension approfondie =
des concepts d=E2=80=99<strong data-start=3D"6917" data-end=3D"6927">entit=
=C3=A9</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"6929" data-end=3D"6941">attribut</st=
rong> et <strong data-start=3D"6945" data-end=3D"6957">relation</strong> es=
t essentielle =C3=A0 la conception robuste d=E2=80=99une base de donn=C3=A9=
es relationnelle.</p>
<p data-start=3D"7036" data-end=3D"7194">=E2=9C=94 Une entit=C3=A9 devient =
une <strong data-start=3D"7061" data-end=3D"7070">table</strong><br data-st=
