<ol data-start=3D"5323" data-end=3D"5661">
<li data-start=3D"5323" data-end=3D"5377">
<p data-start=3D"5326" data-end=3D"5377"><strong data-start=3D"5326" data-e=
nd=3D"5364">=C3=89crire des migrations idempotentes</strong> si possible.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5378" data-end=3D"5454">
<p data-start=3D"5381" data-end=3D"5454"><strong data-start=3D"5381" data-e=
nd=3D"5412">Toujours tester les scripts</strong> sur une base de test avant=
 en production.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5455" data-end=3D"5508">
<p data-start=3D"5458" data-end=3D"5508"><strong data-start=3D"5458" data-e=
nd=3D"5498">Versionner les fichiers de migration</strong> avec Git.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5509" data-end=3D"5582">
<p data-start=3D"5512" data-end=3D"5582"><strong data-start=3D"5512" data-e=
nd=3D"5560">Ne jamais supprimer directement des colonnes</strong> sans audi=
t pr=C3=A9alable.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5583" data-end=3D"5661">
<p data-start=3D"5586" data-end=3D"5661">Utiliser des <strong data-start=3D=
"5599" data-end=3D"5615">outils CI/CD</strong> pour ex=C3=A9cuter les migra=
tions automatiquement.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"5663" data-end=3D"5666">
<h2 data-start=3D"5668" data-end=3D"5683">=E2=9C=85 Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5685" data-end=3D"5818">La gestion de sch=C3=A9mas et les =
migrations de base de donn=C3=A9es sont des <strong data-start=3D"5753" dat=
a-end=3D"5778">composantes critiques</strong> d=E2=80=99un projet de d=C3=
=A9veloppement logiciel.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5820" data-end=3D"6137">
<li data-start=3D"5820" data-end=3D"5870">
<p data-start=3D"5822" data-end=3D"5870"><code data-start=3D"5822" data-end=
=3D"5837">CREATE SCHEMA</code> permet une organisation logique.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5871" data-end=3D"5947">
<p data-start=3D"5873" data-end=3D"5947">Les scripts SQL (<code data-start=
=3D"5890" data-end=3D"5897">ALTER</code>, <code data-start=3D"5899" data-en=
d=3D"5905">DROP</code>, etc.) assurent la flexibilit=C3=A9 du mod=C3=A8le.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5948" data-end=3D"6137">
<p data-start=3D"5950" data-end=3D"6137">Les outils comme <strong data-star=
t=3D"5967" data-end=3D"5980">Liquibase</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"5982=
" data-end=3D"5992">Flyway</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"5996" data-end=
=3D"6014">Prisma Migrate</strong> offrent des solutions puissantes pour ver=
sionner, tester et d=C3=A9ployer les modifications de mani=C3=A8re professi=
onnelle et s=C3=BBre.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6139" data-end=3D"6289">Ce sujet devient encore plus impor=
tant =C3=A0 mesure que l'application cro=C3=AEt, notamment dans les environ=
nements multi-d=C3=A9veloppeurs, CI/CD, DevOps et Cloud.</p>
